UI/UX DESIGN NOTES (PIXEL BRIDGE THEME)
1.	NAVIGATION
• Fixed-top navbar with glassmorphism (backdrop-filter: blur)
• Logo on left: "Pixel Bridge" with a small bridge icon
• Menu on right: Home · About · Services · Work · Team · Blog · Contact
• On scroll → background becomes solidifies (scrim effect)
2.	ANIMATIONS (subtle, performant)
• Page transitions: fade-slide-up
• Cards: scale on hover • Skill cards: tilt 3D effect on mouse m
• Scroll-triggered: number counters, reveal-in-viewport
• Hero: floating pixel particles (canvas animation)
3.	MICRO-INTERACTIONS
• Custom cursor (optional) with glow trail
• Button hover: gradient shift + slight scale
• Nav link hover: underline that animates left→right
• Images: desaturated → colour on hover



